    kind: work_item  # 6b07
    title: "framework_patterns: the parent_base_class + method_name arm ignores symbol_kind, so the key is decorative there (9 lit.yaml rules would match a free function named render / updated)"  # 6b07
    status: todo_hard  # 6b07
    priority: 3  # 6b07
    parent:  # 6b07
